  "description": "FAWWEI crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C106 H128 La4 N17 O29 3+,C105 H124 La4 N17 O28 3+,6(C1 H4 O1),6(N1 O3 1-). From the CIF bond table, La5 (La) has 8 O neighbors; La6 (La) has 7 O neighbors; La7 (La) has 8 O neighbors; La8 (La) has 7 O neighbors; La1 (La) has 7 O neighbors; La2 (La) has 7 O neighbors; La3 (La) has 8 O neighbors; La4 (La) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 4 components; largest component is a chain with insufficient metal sites for a 3D shape classification. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.005-4.093 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.24-111.12°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [La4L4(NO3)]·3NO3·xCH3OH·yH2O·zCH3CN (dried: C104H120La4N20O36). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
